{"4785230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Optimal Amount of Punching", "steam_appid": 4785230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎉🎉🎉 Happy 32nd Birthday Timmylittle! 🎉🎉🎉</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's finally time for Timmylittle to set out on his grand adventure, but little does he know, that <strong>Evil is lurking around every corner...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will he persevere in the face of overwhelming amounts of Gobbos, or will spend his time making completely avoidable mistakes? <i>That's up to you! 😊</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785230/extras/059660de4ed095fb0163e7fc2e577fe2.poster.avif?t=1780310628\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785230/extras/059660de4ed095fb0163e7fc2e577fe2.webm?t=1780310628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785230/extras/059660de4ed095fb0163e7fc2e577fe2.mp4?t=1780310628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👊👊👊 <strong>Punch Super Optimally</strong> 👊👊👊</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about <strong>punching</strong> <strong>more than the optimal amount.</strong> You will be trolled, you will be tricked, you will rage - but most importantly, you will punch. A lot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is a tool if you punch it with enough confidence. Try not to feel too embarrassed when they punch back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785230/extras/a7e0af00e64f9d868fb54ed198cc2b58.poster.avif?t=1780310628\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785230/extras/a7e0af00e64f9d868fb54ed198cc2b58.webm?t=1780310628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785230/extras/a7e0af00e64f9d868fb54ed198cc2b58.mp4?t=1780310628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👿👿👿 <strong>Lord Evil Awaits...</strong> 👿👿👿</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on an epic quest to <strong>vanquish Evil's shining nipples</strong>, and recover the Ward Crystals that protect the land. From Evil. And probably other bad stuff too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet an assortment of fun characters along the way, and discover news way to be unhelpful to people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785230/extras/91724937bec973a0a12c0c2e72f07d88.poster.avif?t=1780310628\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785230/extras/91724937bec973a0a12c0c2e72f07d88.webm?t=1780310628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4785230/extras/91724937bec973a0a12c0c2e72f07d88.mp4?t=1780310628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎉🎉🎉 Happy 32nd Birthday Timmylittle! 🎉🎉🎉</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's finally time for Timmylittle to set out on his grand adventure, but little does he know, that <strong>Evil is lurking around every corner...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will he persevere in the face of overwhelming amounts of Gobbos, or will spend his time making completely avoidable mistakes? <i>That's up to you! 😊</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi